WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.100
A page works for everyone when its tags say what each part is

2
00:00:04.953 --> 00:00:09.503
This page looks fine. A screen reader finds a picture with no words.

3
00:00:10.207 --> 00:00:13.682
alt describes the picture for anyone who can't see it.

4
00:00:14.358 --> 00:00:19.083
The box has no name. A label, joined by for and id, gives it one.

5
00:00:21.209 --> 00:00:24.609
It looks almost the same, and now everyone can use it.
